// North shore suburb (stub): a flat, pre-war grid suburb at the city's edge near a lake.
// Brick bungalows and fifties ranches on narrow lots with alleys and detached garages,
// parkway elms and maples, strip malls and a shopping center with a big parking field, a
// concrete tower hotel as the landmark, an expressway along one side, forest preserve and
// golf course green. See docs/SCENARIOS.md.
//
// Stub: plausible numbers that validate and generate a flat, all-grid place. Tune when the
// scenario is built (M7). Layout and units: crates/world/src/template.rs.
RegionTemplate(
    name: "north_shore_suburb",
    driving_side: Right,
    sign_language: EnUs,
    era: EraDefaults(year: 1986, street_lights: MercuryVapor, palette: "brick_red_beige"),

